			Topic: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!! &nbsp;(Read 1104 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813" title="View the profile of Justyse">Justyse</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 48<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img216.exs.cx/img216/6516/convicavat44as.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Pirate pwns your tards<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/forums" title="&lt;Conviction&gt;" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tribeof3@shentel.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14835#msg14835"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14835#msg14835">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> February 22, 2005, 08:14:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I like it so far. I agree with Dose about giving the guild lobby or guild hall a guild tribute master. At this point, shes literally all the way across the zone, seems a little silly, the guild lobby seems more appropriate /shrug<br /><br />The guild halls are fun, my whole guild seems to enjoy having a feeling of their &quot;own place&quot;. The tradeskill thingies in each hall are nice. The portal is really convenient for adding late to raids or going to help someone out real quick. The fact that buff timers stop is very cool <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />I again agree with Dose that this should have been a download and not an expansion really. I dont see any major high end content, then again, I havent seen the whole thing. But I think it gave the game what it was lacking... some small, fun, things to do in offtime ie tasks etc. that dont require sitting in one place forever. <br />Like EQ2 and WoW, the time constraints of the new content is a little less taxing it &quot;seems&quot;..at least so far. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />The barter/bazaar zones are definately odd, but not horrible. So far, havent seen the barter system used that much though. I&#039;m wondering when it&#039;ll catch on, if ever.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635046" target="_blank"><img src="http://img89.exs.cx/img89/4849/justygl24ky.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
