								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=371"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14887#msg14887"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14887#msg14887">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #33 on:</b> February 22, 2005, 12:14:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The new trend seems to be adding quicker expansions (at least, they seem to be more frequent) with less total content.&nbsp; The new expansions aren&#039;t being priced less, but then again I don&#039;t see people not purchasing them so I guess that&#039;s the bottom line to Sony.&nbsp; On the plus side, there is tons of content I can do these days.&nbsp; Back in PoP, I had like 3 zones to get experience in.&nbsp; Now I can choose to grind in Oow (PG, RS, WoS, RCoD) or DoN missions or GoD (KT, tipt) or elems (fire, erf) or even LDoN if friends drag me out there.&nbsp; New MM and Paw are on the list at some point, just haven&#039;t had the time to explore.&nbsp; There&#039;s really alot of variety out there right now, moreso than at any other time I can remember.&nbsp; <br /><br />No clue if DoN&#039;s got an endgame, but I haven&#039;t heard of ubers sitting around with nothing to do yet.&nbsp; Hopefully the dragons will provide some fun for people for a few months, or until the next expansion.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Shakro Shakdaddy<br />70 Fateseer of Bertoxxulous<br />Brew Masters
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14913"></a>
