								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14913#msg14913"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14913#msg14913">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #34 on:</b> February 22, 2005, 04:15:23 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well only a few guilds if that across all servers have actually finished GoD and no one has totally beaten OoW yet, so the top guilds aren&#039;t out of things to do yet.&nbsp; They will be soon, but I&#039;m not sure why that&#039;s a big deal, honestly.&nbsp; If one percent of your playerbase &quot;beats&quot; the game before something even harder is added, so what?&nbsp; <br /><br />That and there are supposedly some very difficult raids in DoN yet to be discovered.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
