	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14971"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Administrator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14522<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14971#msg14971"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14971#msg14971">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #36 on:</b> February 23, 2005, 07:50:27 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It&#039;s a pretty shallow expansion overall really.<br /><br />They stuck a fair amount of time into ruining the bazaar zone, and in general, the zones have all the graphics appeal of donkey kong jr. <br /><br />Seriously, the Lavastorm redux looks like a total peice of crap, it doesn&#039;t hold a candle to EQ2 or WoW, and alot of people said it was better etc... you&#039;ve got a grey landscape... with grey trees, some new lava that a 5 year old with crayons could have drawn, I&#039;ve give who ever redid the drakes a bit of credit, cause those look better, but the goblins look like.... well.... they sure as hell dun look like goblins, more like party goers to Shado&#039;s last blowout. (That&#039;s how much fear they strike into someone.)<br /><br />It looks like they spent alot of time to make the dragans get some depth, and reworked those models, but I would hardly say that the graphics in general are anything to make this a good expansion.<br /><br />The story line is pretty weak too. With all those wars going on, I was hoping for a return to the Ring of Scale type of story line etc... there&#039;s alot there that can be used to further the old story lines, but nope, we had to make a new one... yet again.<br /><br />Sheesh.... 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kinladar&amp;s_id=38" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/sig-kinladar-wow.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><a href="http://www.chaoticdiscord.org" target="_blank">Chaotic Discord</a> found in {World of Warcraft}<br />Guild Leader of Fires of Time (Retired)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14981"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486" title="View the profile of Bobo">Bobo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 26<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/weasel.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14981#msg14981"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14981#msg14981">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #37 on:</b> February 23, 2005, 10:59:13 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">It&#039;s a pretty shallow expansion overall really.</div><br /><br />I would say that was a shallow review. <br /><br />kin , Obviously&nbsp; you have the right to your opinion, but do you expect anyone to take heed? You don’t play anymore and logging on and wandering into to a zone does not make you qualified as a neutral reviewer. <br /><br />Play it for about a couple of weeks, do some missions, task, raids, set up a vendor, get a corpse summon, then your words might carry some weight with others. But now you just sound like a bitter ex Eqer.<br /><br />You have become the Anti -frodlin<br /><br /><br />As for me.<br /><br />DoN has been keeping us all really busy. When not raiding about 90% of my time has been in DoN. We are doing lots of missions, solo task, the 24 man raids, starting to do the 54 man raids, getting new spells and eventually the 300 hp mana &amp; endurance bonus.<br /><br />The rewards at the Mission vendors are pretty good. After about three missions you can purchase a 100% weight reduction pack 10 giant slots. With every thing else the prices are very reasonable&nbsp; <br /><br />Bazaar ain’t the greatest but who cares I am still selling buying and getting over it <br /><br />Since we seem to be scaling it I give it a 8.5 out of 10 (so far) <br /><br />&nbsp;<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
